 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Nominal style with passive",
     "texto": [
      "In commercial texts everything is mixed: **Nach der Zahlung wird die Quittung ausgestellt** (after payment the receipt is issued). The noun expresses the action and the passive says who or how it is done.",
      "With **werden** the process is described; with **sein** and participle, the result: **Die Quittung ist ausgestellt** (the receipt is issued)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Quick review",
     "texto": [
      "**muss bezahlt werden** expresses obligation; **kann umgetauscht werden**, possibility; **ist geliefert worden**, a prior process; **wurde gedankt**, an impersonal passive with dative. Distinguish these forms from the state (**ist geliefert**) and from the alternative **ist zu bezahlen** (has to be paid)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "Structure",
